      √ calculates mass requirement accurately across catalogue + 100g retention (12 ms)
      √ rejects under-mass sample without explicit acknowledgement (74 ms)
      √ accepts under-mass sample WITH explicit acknowledgement and records override (39 ms)
    2. Three Coordinate Formats Conversion (RC-05)
      √ parses Decimal Degrees accurately (1 ms)
      √ parses Degrees Minutes Seconds (DMS) accurately into Decimal Degrees (1 ms)
      √ parses UTM with Zone & Hemisphere accurately into WGS84 Decimal Degrees
      √ POST /api/reception/parse-coordinates exposes all three formats over API (17 ms)
    3. Positional Uncertainty Defaults & Composite Depth (RC-06, RC-11)
      √ persists uncertainty, composite radius, and numeric depths (28 ms)
    4. Derived Location Confidence Resisting Unevidenced HIGH (RC-07)
      √ derives HIGH confidence ONLY for evidenced GPS with tight accuracy
      √ resists HIGH confidence for manual desk entry even if claimed tight uncertainty (1 ms)
      √ downgrades intake claiming HIGH confidence on DESK_PASTE method (33 ms)
    5. Offline Reverse Geocoding Fallback (RC-08)
      √ falls back to offline administrative boundaries safely (74 ms)
    6. 40-Sample Consignment Intake with 2 Exceptions (RC-12, RC-13, RC-14)
      √ processes 40-sample atomic batch with 2 rejected exceptions resulting in PARTIAL status (548 ms)
    7. Rejected State Distinctness (RC-19)
      √ ensures rejected sample has status RECEIVED_REJECTED in database (1 ms)
      √ strictly excludes rejected sample from GET /api/samples/expected backlog (20 ms)
      √ returns rejected sample under status=RECEIVED_REJECTED query (12 ms)
      √ enforces workflow transition bounds: permits DISPOSED, rejects PROCESSING (1 ms)
    8. Custody Timestamps and Counter-Signature (RC-19)
      √ records physical handover separate from system entry with officer counter-signature (21 ms)

