    √ 6. Dispositioned batch clears from actionable pending exception queues while remaining in history (46 ms)
    √ 7. Unknown disposition decision is rejected with 400 INVALID_DISPOSITION_DECISION (10 ms)
    √ 8. flagBatchResults preserves non-QC invalidity flags (MANUAL_INVALID) and immutable released records (69 ms)
    √ 9. REANALYZE_BATCH updates associated workItems to REPEAT_REQUIRED atomically (170 ms)
    √ 10. audit.qc queue qcFailedCount strictly excludes dispositioned batches (26 ms)
    √ 11. flagBatchResults preserves invalidity on QC_PASS for unflagged, unknown-flagged, and previously rejected results (25 ms)
    √ 12. flagBatchResults strictly preserves immutability for published reports and terminal samples (ARCHIVED/DISPOSED) (19 ms)
    √ 13. Conflicting disposition decision is rejected with 409 DISPOSITION_CONFLICT (62 ms)
    √ 14. Concurrent identical dispositions resolve idempotently; conflicting concurrent decisions fail with 409 (58 ms)
