    √ 17. Multi-step probe: initial isValid:false, flags:[] -> QC_FAIL -> PROCEED_WITH_WARNING remains isValid:false (8 ms)
    √ 18. Initially valid results (isValid:true, flags:[]) restore to valid upon QC_PASS and PROCEED_WITH_WARNING (9 ms)
    √ 19. Results with unknown or malformed flags stay invalid across FAIL -> PASS (11 ms)
