  WP-D: Laboratory Lifecycle & Project Relationships
    1. Laboratory Workspace Scoping (GET /api/labs/:id/workspace)
      √ Super Admin retrieves full workspace with accurate workload counts (40 ms)
      √ Lab Manager retrieves workspace for own lab (14 ms)
      √ Lab Manager cannot access workspace of another lab (403 Forbidden) (5 ms)
    2. Strict Profile Allowlist & Validation (PATCH /api/labs/:id/profile)
      √ Manager updates own lab profile with valid IANA timezone and capacity (17 ms)
      √ Manager updates timezone independently while omitting capacity (Refs #109) (6 ms)
      √ Manager unsets optional capacity by submitting explicit null or empty string (Refs #109) (9 ms)
      √ Manager preserves zero capacity as zero rather than null (Refs #109) (4 ms)
      √ Rejects invalid capacity values (decimal, negative, alphanumeric, out-of-range) with 400 INVALID_CAPACITY (Refs #109) (27 ms)
      √ Workspace reflects configured timezone and clears MISSING_TIMEZONE attention warning (Refs #109) (32 ms)
      √ Rejects invalid IANA time zone identifier with 400 INVALID_TIMEZONE (4 ms)
      √ Rejects attempt to alter immutable fields (id, code, isActive) with 400 IMMUTABLE_FIELDS_REJECTED (4 ms)
      √ Manager cannot update profile of another lab (403 Forbidden) (3 ms)
    3. Lifecycle Transition Preview (POST /api/labs/:id/lifecycle-preview)
      √ Super Admin previews PAUSED impact, returning open counts and signed reviewToken (4 ms)
      √ Non-admin cannot preview lifecycle changes (403 Forbidden) (4 ms)
    4. Lifecycle State Transitions & Anti-Cascade Safety (POST /api/labs/:id/lifecycle)
      √ Omitting review token is blocked with 400 REVIEW_TOKEN_REQUIRED (4 ms)
      √ Super Admin pauses laboratory with valid reviewToken: sets operationalStatus=PAUSED, lab.isActive=false (10 ms)
      √ When laboratory is paused, new work assignments are blocked with 400 LAB_PAUSED (9 ms)
      √ Attempting to retire a lab with open work items is blocked with 422 UNRESOLVED_WORK_ITEMS (8 ms)
      √ Super Admin resumes laboratory with valid reviewToken: sets operationalStatus=ACTIVE, lab.isActive=true (8 ms)
      √ Concurrent lifecycle transition with stale preview token returns 409 STALE_TARGET_REVISION (27 ms)
      √ Injected audit failure rolls back lifecycle transaction atomically (9 ms)
    5. Project-to-Lab Relationships (GET/PATCH /api/projects/:id/lab-access)
      √ Project owner manager reads project lab access (5 ms)
      √ Owner Lab Manager adds Lab B as a servicing laboratory (7 ms)
      √ Non-owner manager cannot modify project servicing labs (403 Forbidden) (3 ms)

